# ============================================================
# Internal documentation
#
# The repository is PUBLIC (github.com/IvanBaltazar-Dev/ControlLocal), so
# `docs/` does NOT travel: it carries the North Star, the commissions, the
# audits and `docs/ai/seguridad-no-leer.md`.
#
# The exception is narrow and mechanical: a document travels ONLY if a test
# READS it, because otherwise a clean clone cannot run the build. There is no
# copy under `src/test/resources` on purpose -- two copies diverge in silence,
# which is the disease that cost eight rounds in 5B. Authority stays single.
#
#   docs/ai/matriz-codigos-estado.md          <- CatalogoEstadosTest
#   docs/ai/catalogo-productores-canonico.md  <- CatalogoProductoresTest
#   docs/ai/decision-estados-sin-productor.md <- EstadosSinProductorTest
#   docs/ai/matriz-operacion-rol.md           <- MatrizOperacionRolTest
#   docs/ai/prototipos/nucleo-brox.js         <- PoliticaUnicaTest
#   docs/ai/modelo/*.js                       <- node gate-modelo-universal.js
#
# The six tests FAIL (they do not skip) when the file is missing, so a clone
# without them is a red build, not a silent green.
#
# The `docs/*` + `!` shape is deliberate: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so each level has to be opened before the
# contents of the next one are excluded.
# ============================================================

docs/*
!docs/ai/
docs/ai/*
!docs/ai/matriz-codigos-estado.md
!docs/ai/catalogo-productores-canonico.md
!docs/ai/decision-estados-sin-productor.md
!docs/ai/matriz-operacion-rol.md
# Autoridad del corte P0: la regla viva de quien puede escribir la propiedad y
# cada encargo. Viaja porque GOBIERNA -- un documento que decide y no viaja no
# puede gobernar un clon limpio, y `AutoridadDeLaPropiedadTest` lo comprueba.
!docs/ai/decision-autoridad-de-edicion-de-la-propiedad.md
# Marco de alcances y frontera de informacion de BROX Intelligence (D-I-1). No
# hay codigo de Intelligence todavia; viaja porque fija que puede salir de la
# operacion interna, y eso condiciona cada salida nueva.
!docs/ai/decision-brox-intelligence-alcances-y-frontera.md
!docs/ai/modelo/
docs/ai/modelo/*
!docs/ai/modelo/gate-modelo-universal.js
!docs/ai/modelo/modelo-universal.js
!docs/ai/modelo/motor-captura.js
!docs/ai/prototipos/
docs/ai/prototipos/*
!docs/ai/prototipos/nucleo-brox.js


# ============================================================
# Internal development / verification tooling
#
# Same rule as `docs/`: only what a clean clone needs to run the closing run
# (`verificacion/Verificar-Cierre.ps1`) travels.
#
#   Verificar-Cierre.ps1      the closing run itself, read by GateDeCierreTest
#   gate-modelo-universal.sql step 2 of the closing run
#   Invoke-E2E.ps1            step 5, and it needs docker-compose.e2e.yml
#   e2e-context.ps1           dot-sourced by every suite
#   lib-alta-inmueble.ps1     dot-sourced by `editor-universal`
#   e2e-<suite>.ps1           the five suites of the DEFAULT $Suites list
#
# `evidencia/` does NOT travel (2.4 MB, 69 files): it is dated history, not a
# requirement to run anything. Neither do the E2E suites outside the closing
# run's default list, nor `operacion/`, nor `backups/`.
# ============================================================

backend-spring/operacion/
backend-spring/backups/

backend-spring/verificacion/*
!backend-spring/verificacion/Verificar-Cierre.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/gate-modelo-universal.sql
!backend-spring/verificacion/Invoke-E2E.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/e2e-context.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/lib-alta-inmueble.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/e2e-comision-movimientos.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/e2e-disponibilidad-contrato.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/e2e-f4-solicitud.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/e2e-estabilizacion-alquiler.ps1
!backend-spring/verificacion/e2e-editor-universal.ps1

frontend-angular/tools/


